WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:20.895 --> 00:00:23.523
Okay, let's get started!
All of us Japanese here

00:00:23.648 --> 00:00:26.317
We're all on the same ship
We're all survivors

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:29.070
Don't you keep it inside

00:00:29.154 --> 00:00:30.196
Let it all out

00:00:30.280 --> 00:00:31.781
What's inside your heart?

00:00:32.949 --> 00:00:34.492
I can't rap.

00:00:34.576 --> 00:00:37.287
Hey, man! "Can't" isn't allowed here!

00:00:37.370 --> 00:00:40.331
We don't have a road
Or firm ground or time

00:00:40.415 --> 00:00:42.292
Let out your frustrations, man!

00:00:46.004 --> 00:00:47.922
People in this country are so subdued

00:00:48.006 --> 00:00:50.008
They're all good-natured and timid

00:00:50.091 --> 00:00:51.926
They're worried about appearances

00:00:52.010 --> 00:00:54.846
They're introverted, insular
And do things in groups

00:00:54.929 --> 00:00:57.098
They treat you like a freak
If you're different

00:00:57.182 --> 00:00:59.934
So damn picky and hammering down
The nail that sticks out

00:01:00.060 --> 00:01:02.687
It's totally different
Than foreign countries

00:01:02.729 --> 00:01:05.523
I'm glad this country is sinking!
But I won't be taken with it!

00:01:07.233 --> 00:01:10.945
Hey there, Japanese dude.
He's dissing Japan, man!

00:01:11.029 --> 00:01:13.531
Come on, give him what for!
Let's hear your answer!

00:01:14.157 --> 00:01:16.201
What? Well...

00:01:17.494 --> 00:01:19.496
Hey, you there, smart-aleck

00:01:19.788 --> 00:01:21.122
Quit talking big

00:01:23.083 --> 00:01:25.418
You go complaining that you hate Japan

00:01:25.502 --> 00:01:28.129
That negativity is so totally Japanese

00:01:28.213 --> 00:01:30.715
There's little difference
Between individuality and selfishness

00:01:30.757 --> 00:01:33.551
If you assert yourself too much
Life just becomes painful

00:01:33.885 --> 00:01:36.513
And what's wrong with being good-natured?

00:01:36.596 --> 00:01:39.349
Getting your wallet back
When you lose it is awesome!

00:01:39.432 --> 00:01:42.018
We don't hurt others
When we worry about appearances

00:01:42.102 --> 00:01:45.188
That consideration shows our kindness
That's what I like

00:01:45.271 --> 00:01:47.732
I admit we can be picky about details

00:01:47.774 --> 00:01:50.860
That's why we've got such good service
Thoughtfulness and accuracy

00:01:50.944 --> 00:01:53.738
You complain we're too serious?
That's our special talent!

00:01:53.822 --> 00:01:56.616
Everyone in the world trusts
Made in Japan!

00:01:56.741 --> 00:01:58.910
You can connect to the world
Just through the Internet

00:01:58.993 --> 00:02:02.080
Quit talking big just because
You think you know it all now!

00:02:02.163 --> 00:02:04.874
If you hate it that much
Then get the hell out!

00:02:04.958 --> 00:02:07.252
If you regret it someday, what do I care?

00:02:07.335 --> 00:02:10.255
Yes! You can do it! I knew you could!

00:02:10.755 --> 00:02:12.632
Okay, lady. Now it's your turn.

00:02:13.258 --> 00:02:15.927
Don't sit silent, now's the time to talk

00:02:19.013 --> 00:02:22.016
I'm sick of your whining
Foreign countries and Japan

00:02:22.142 --> 00:02:24.602
What the heck is the point
In comparing countries?

00:02:24.686 --> 00:02:27.605
Every place has its good points
And its bad points too

00:02:27.689 --> 00:02:30.400
There are good people and bad people
And people that are neither

00:02:30.483 --> 00:02:33.278
There is crime everywhere
Miracles can happen anywhere

00:02:33.361 --> 00:02:35.905
I'm sick of everyone's opinion!
I'll decide for myself!

00:02:35.989 --> 00:02:38.867
There were never any lines
On the globe before, so why now?

00:02:38.950 --> 00:02:41.870
It's nonsense to judge
What people from a country are like

00:02:41.953 --> 00:02:44.581
I've finally realized this
And at a time like this

00:02:44.664 --> 00:02:47.208
It's way more important who we're with
Than where we are

00:02:47.292 --> 00:02:50.128
If I can be with the people with me now
I can survive

00:02:50.211 --> 00:02:52.255
This is my land, this is Earth!

00:02:53.923 --> 00:02:55.592
Do you want to try, old man?

00:02:55.675 --> 00:03:00.597
I'LL PUNCH THE PEOPLE WHO MOCKED ME

00:03:01.931 --> 00:03:03.266
You're really going to do it?

00:03:06.477 --> 00:03:07.520
It feels better, right?

00:03:07.604 --> 00:03:08.813
You do it too, KITE.

00:03:09.314 --> 00:03:11.024
I never keep anything inside.

00:03:11.107 --> 00:03:12.275
You sure don't.

00:03:14.277 --> 00:03:15.320
Hey, guys.

00:03:16.404 --> 00:03:17.530
Let's take a photo.

